    "%lld+": {},
    "A finished session shows its last output, and can be restarted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une session terminée affiche sa dernière sortie, et peut être relancée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A local log of what the application did, never of what you typed, kept for two weeks. Exported only when you save it yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un journal local de ce qu’a fait l’application, jamais de ce que vous avez saisi, conservé deux semaines. Exporté seulement quand vous l’enregistrez vous-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A process from that run may still be running (pid %@) and was left alone; check Activity Monitor.": {
      "comment": "Process identifiers, separated by commas.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
