            "value": "Le terminal n’a encore rien affiché."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time the agent's process was running in Vibe Manager, whether it was working or waiting for you. Time the Mac spent asleep is not counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
