          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Value to try for %@": {
      "comment": "A field's label.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valeur à essayer pour %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Values to try appear here for each field of the template.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les valeurs à essayer apparaissent ici pour chaque champ du modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vibe Manager runs coding agents on your behalf. macOS asks for permission every time one of them reads your Desktop, Documents, Downloads, an external disk or iCloud Drive — and it asks in the name of this application, once per folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vibe Manager exécute des agents de code en votre nom. macOS demande une autorisation chaque fois que l’un d’eux lit votre Bureau, vos Documents, vos Téléchargements, un disque externe ou iCloud Drive — et il la demande au nom de cette application, une fois par dossier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vibe Manager stopped unexpectedly. %lld sessions were running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vibe Manager stopped unexpectedly. %lld session was running."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vibe Manager stopped unexpectedly. %lld sessions were running."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vibe Manager s’est arrêté de façon inattendue. %lld session était en cours."
                }
              },
              "many": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vibe Manager s’est arrêté de façon inattendue. %lld sessions étaient en cours."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vibe Manager s’est arrêté de façon inattendue. %lld sessions étaient en cours."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you working on?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur quoi travaillez-vous ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is it for?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À quoi sert-il ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you typed is kept until it is saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous avez tapé est conservé jusqu’à son enregistrement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When quitting with agents running": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En quittant avec des agents en cours d’exécution"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, macOS asks for permission each time an agent reads your Desktop, Documents, Downloads, an external disk or iCloud Drive. Turning it on takes effect the next time Vibe Manager is opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans lui, macOS demande l’autorisation chaque fois qu’un agent lit votre Bureau, vos Documents, vos Téléchargements, un disque externe ou iCloud Drive. Son activation prend effet à la prochaine ouverture de Vibe Manager."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier de travail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worth trying when the previous model is what the agent refused, rather than the conversation itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utile quand l’agent a refusé le modèle précédent, plutôt que la conversation elle-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can skip this. Agents still run, and macOS only asks when one of them reaches a protected folder. You can come back to it in Settings at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez passer cette étape. Les agents fonctionnent quand même, et macOS ne demande que lorsque l’un d’eux accède à un dossier protégé. Vous pourrez y revenir à tout moment dans les Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents are still running in the background, but Vibe Manager could not reattach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos agents s’exécutent toujours en arrière-plan, mais Vibe Manager n’a pas pu s’y reconnecter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents are still running in the background, but Vibe Manager could not reattach. %@": {
      "comment": "Why the application could not reattach to its agents, in one sentence.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos agents s’exécutent toujours en arrière-plan, mais Vibe Manager n’a pas pu s’y reconnecter. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your changes are lost if you don't save them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos modifications seront perdues si vous ne les enregistrez pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "and %lld more": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "many": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "et %lld autres"
                }
              },
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "et %lld autre"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "et %lld autres"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "and %lld more, not listed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "many": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "et %lld autres, non listés"
                }
              },
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "et %lld autre, non listé"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "et %lld autres, non listés"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "first start": {
      "comment": "In the line a terminal shows above an agent: how it was started.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "premier démarrage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "given a summary": {
      "comment": "In the line a terminal shows above a switched agent: how it was started.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "avec un résumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "live": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "en direct"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS protects %@: it may ask for permission the first time the agent reads this folder.": {
      "comment": "A protected place: “your Desktop”, “your Documents folder”, “iCloud Drive”.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS protège %@ : il peut demander une autorisation la première fois que l’agent lit ce dossier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "new process": {
      "comment": "In the line a terminal shows above an agent: how it was started.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "nouveau processus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "new process, given a summary": {
      "comment": "In the line a terminal shows above a restarted agent: how it was started.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "nouveau processus, avec un résumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no match": {
      "comment": "A pattern found nothing in the field's value.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "aucune correspondance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nothing yet": {
      "comment": "What a pattern takes out of a field that is still empty.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rien pour l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "resumed conversation": {
      "comment": "In the line a terminal shows above a restarted agent: how it was started.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "conversation reprise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "same conversation": {
      "comment": "In the line a terminal shows above a switched agent: how it was started.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "même conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "separator.restart": {
      "comment": "The title of the line a terminal shows above a restarted agent: a noun.",
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
